{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/macos/Runner/Configs/AppInfo.xcconfig","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:10:58.754344Z","id":"553cb4349577b03fbb19df2eea3893a0449e5ed2de27bac5e118e2521c88cddb","body":{"detail":"Verified with no certificate: without macos/Signing.xcconfig, 'just app-macos' (8fed90be) builds; codesign -dv shows Signature=adhoc for clax_app.app and Contents/Resources/clax (sandbox + inherit entitlements), and codesign --verify --deep --strict passes. With a placeholder Signing.xcconfig, xcodebuild -showBuildSettings resolves CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development and DEVELOPMENT_TEAM for Debug, Release and Profile (an include from the project-level Debug.xcconfig instead leaves CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = -). Not verified: a real signed build. Steps once a certificate exists: (1) security find-certificate -c 'Apple Development' -p | openssl x509 -noout -subject, take OU as the team ID; (2) sed 's/XXXXXXXXXX/<team>/' apps/clax_app/macos/Signing.xcconfig.example > apps/clax_app/macos/Signing.xcconfig; (3) just app-macos. If xcodebuild fails with 'No profiles for dev.empathic.clax' (CODE_SIGN_STYLE is Automatic at target level, so Signing.xcconfig cannot switch it), open apps/clax_app/macos/Runner.xcworkspace in Xcode once, pick the team on the Runner target's Signing & Capabilities, build, then revert any project.pbxproj change and rerun just app-macos. (4) codesign -dv on build/macos/Build/Products/Release/clax_app.app and its Contents/Resources/clax: both show Authority=Apple Development and the same TeamIdentifier; codesign -d --entitlements - on clax lists only app-sandbox and inherit. (5) Launch: the daemon starts (a sandboxed helper whose signature does not match crashes at launch; Settings shows the daemon up). (6) The keychain asks once (the old item lists the ad-hoc build): Always Allow. Rebuild with just app-macos, relaunch: no prompt.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":16},"end":{"line":23},"content_hash":"907329260faa7a054fced53aa9ba8e6ebe0109483600a5f8c26e007aa9e3bcb8"},"summary":"The team-signed macOS build is untested: no Apple Development certificate was on this Mac","tags":["status:needs-verification","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
